Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Split settings into two pages: General and Behavior.
 Added new Setting KWin BorderlessMaximumWindows to the Behavior Page. This
 setting uses a C++ QML Extension that manipulates ~/.config/kwinrc with
 KConfig and uses DBus to reload the KWin Config if necessary. KWins
 BorderlessMaximumWindows is set by a lot of people that use this applet.

